{"version":1,"key":"card:145","content":{"id":145,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"IntersectionObserver","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 可以监听元素是否出现在视口中，其使用方法如下","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a9d848ad-d22b-4ad5-ace7-300432d6cb58","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// 创建 observer，接收两个参数\n// 1. fn，被监听的元素出现在视口中时触发的回调函数\n// 2. 创建 observer 的选项，包括 root, rootMargin 以及 threshold\nconst observer = new IntersectionObserver(fn, options);\n\n// 监听感兴趣的元素\nobserver.observe(element);","collabId":"61e278f0-3620-49c2-9347-24d39b43e0e5","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"d9c6a7a0-6dc9-4302-9c68-500955d8bbee","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"47b1b54d-f1d0-4bca-8781-beaf73361668"},{"children":[{"text":"其中回调函数 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fn","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 将会收到包含多个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"entry","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的数组（因为可以同时监听多个元素，使用统一的回调函数处理），每个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"entry","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 包含如下属性：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f58982d6-29d0-42ee-9616-1197f949fa4e","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"intersectionRatio","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：出现在视口中的元素与整体的比例","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b12b309f-1817-4bcb-b048-2e0d3ec12f37","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0596ac4e-ff69-4398-88a5-672ff789b0f9","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af8